Trading Dashboard — Version 1 Software and Technology Stack
1. Purpose

This document records the software, programming languages, frameworks, libraries, and development tools used to build Version 1 of the Trading Dashboard application.

The purpose is to make the Version 1 environment reproducible and provide a reference for future development and maintenance.

2. Operating System
Windows

The current application is developed and tested in a Windows environment.

The current development workflow uses Windows-specific paths and PowerShell commands.

Example project/data locations used during development include:

D:\Coding\Trading-Dashboard


and:

D:\DataP\Files


Future versions may improve portability, but Version 1 is currently considered a Windows-oriented desktop application.

