17. Version 2 Performance Optimization

The next development phase will focus on performance rather than introducing major new functionality.

Initial optimization targets include:

Crosshair synchronization throttling
Binary-search nearest-candle lookup
Market-data caching
Timeframe-result caching
Reducing repeated Pandas processing
Reducing unnecessary DataFrame copies
Optimizing Python-to-JavaScript data transfer
Reducing unnecessary chart refresh operations
Optimizing candle conversion
Measuring CPU and memory usage with multiple charts and popup windows

Version 1 functionality should remain unchanged while these optimizations are introduced.

18. Version 1 Baseline Statement

Version 1 is the stable functional baseline of the Trading Dashboard.

All future performance improvements should be evaluated against this baseline.

The Version 1 archive must remain unchanged so that the application can be restored or compared against the original implementation at any time.
